Description:It is your first main phase. You control a tapped Hill Giant and have Act of Treason in hand, with three red mana floating. The opponent is at 3 life and controls a tapped Silent Arbiter. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-threaten-own-creature | Act of Treason can target any creature, including one you already control (CR 115.1, 601.2c): it untaps your tapped Hill Giant and gives it haste, so it can attack for 3; stealing the opponent's 1-power Silent Arbiter instead deals only 1
